From: redox-rpi
Subject: [PATCH] Quit on SDL_QUIT, so that SIGTERM and SIGINT end the game

SDL turns SIGINT and SIGTERM into an SDL_QUIT event. Sopwith never
handled it, so `kill <pid>` left the game running (redox-rpi #405).
---
--- a/src/sdl/video.c	2026-11-15 23:58:59
+++ b/src/sdl/video.c	2026-11-15 23:58:59
@@ -819,6 +819,12 @@
 
 	while (SDL_PollEvent(&event)) {
 		switch (event.type) {
+		case SDL_QUIT:
+			// SDL turns SIGINT and SIGTERM into this event, so
+			// without it `kill` could not end the game.
+			exit(0);
+			break;
+
 		case SDL_KEYDOWN:
 			KeyDown(&event.key);
 			break;
